WEBVTT

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.740
Tsukuyomi Shrine Logbook.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.330
Kept by: Micchan.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.450
The head of the family now spouts out things like

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.000
"I'd feel like a loser if
I just worked like everyone else,"

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.670
and "It's okay to be lazy. I'm only human,"

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:23.880
so I'm starting to see him show some variation.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:26.130
But that's not all.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.590
Every time he says something, he gives me a smug look,

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.510
as if he were imparting words of wisdom.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:33.560
I got so annoyed and ended up losing my temper,

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:34.760
and my mind just went blank.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.640
I only came to my senses several hours later,

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.350
at which time I saw him buck naked before me kneeling on the ground.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:45.940
And instead of "Micchan,"
he was calling me "Master."

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:33.590
I'm an assassin of the evil occult society Arahabaki,

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:36.430
a divine spirit residing inside this Killing Stone golem!

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:38.930
I'm a fox of white face, golden fur, and nine tails!

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:40.560
The Nine-tailed Fox?

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:45.520
In this country, I'm known as the one who plays with scales, Tamamo-no-Mae.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.860
Tamamo-no-Mae...

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:51.230
So, have you ever thought about changing the past?

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:52.780
The past?

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:04.250
I don't remember anything like this happening in my past.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.370
Then could it be that...

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:15.430
My mom wouldn't have been captured so quickly.

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.760
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.680
I possessed you when you were this young

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:24.390
and stayed hidden within you for ten years,

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:28.400
waiting for the moment you would wish to change the past!

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.480
What do you mean?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:35.240
I programmed myself so that I'd awaken when you felt a desire to change the past

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:38.280
so that I could leech on the power of the supreme god you hold,

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:42.370
using it to force a Transformation of the past to meet my desires!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:43.750
A Transformation of the past?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.000
Yes, a Transformation of history!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.170
That is my ability.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:52.460
But it takes preposterous amounts of power.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:57.510
I can't possibly do it without sucking the power of the supreme god from you and using that.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.180
A Transformation of history...

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.720
Changing the past is taboo!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.510
It should never be changed!

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.680
But it's something you wished for.

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:09.060
Tsukuyomi Sasami!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.060
You felt regret!

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:15.190
Regret is a feeling of discontent over some failure in the past.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:21.160
Regret felt by the supreme god can distort space-time and alter that past!

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.080
No way...

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:26.160
It's true. I did feel regret.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.410
I betrayed my mom.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:34.500
After breaking my promise, I wasn't even able to let her rest in peace after she died.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:40.220
Originally, at this place and time,
this Killing Stone golem was not here.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.220
Do you know what that means?

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:46.020
The Transformation of history is already underway!

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:50.020
It was set in motion the moment you felt that regret!

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.350
That can't be...

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:55.530
I'll kill Tsukuyomi Juju right here!

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:59.110
Then the power of the supreme god will be transferred to her daughter,

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:02.870
and that daughter, Tsukuyomi Sasami, will be in my control!

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:05.370
That's the reason for this Transformation of history!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:08.120
Our natural enemy,
the Tsukuyomi Shrine, shall weaken,

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.670
and with the power of the supreme god in our possession,

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:14.790
the evil occult society Arahabaki will become more and more prosperous!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:18.920
Furthermore, Ojou-sama will also be saved somewhat.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.340
Ojou-sama?

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:26.890
And we, Arahabaki, will rule over this world! We'll rule the entire planet!

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.390
You're being ridiculous.

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:35.110
My mom was worked to death just keeping a single country under control.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:40.490
I'm having a hard enough time taking care of my own small body.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:43.110
And you want to rule the world?

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:44.570
Don't make me laugh!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:46.660
You're powerless!

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:51.620
Without that "changing the past" cheat, you're powerless!

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.960
You won't able to do a thing!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.460
You won't be able to rule the world!

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:59.090
That's all you wanted to say?

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:02.340
Now, it's time I ended your life, Tsukuyomi Juju!

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:07.350
The Tsukuyomi Shrine will perish,
and the Arahabaki shall be glorious!

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:12.190
Huh?

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.690
Wait... I remember this.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.110
It's the day my mom died.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.280
All right, good job.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.200
Tsurugi!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:29.160
What on earth happened?

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.910
I'm in the past now,

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.120
I'm in someone else's body,

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.120
and history got Transformed.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.590
This is no time to relax.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:40.300
M-Mom?

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:42.170
Indeed, I am your mother.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.550
Unable to tolerate the foolishness of my immature daughter,

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.970
I have returned from the netherworld.

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:48.720
Finally caught up, huh?

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.890
Huh? What do you mean?

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:55.310
Remember when she put her hand into your belly to insert some drug?

00:06:55.310 --> 00:07:00.070
She was clever enough to also implant a spiritual object of hers,

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.940
so that it could serve as a lifeline for her to return from the netherworld.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:05.570
You put something like that inside me?

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.450
Is that the reason I got all fat?

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:11.450
I tried to keep it to the size of a boil,

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.370
but I couldn't control it very well.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:17.380
I was really stressed out because even the power of the supreme god couldn't make me thin again!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.960
Let's not fight about this now.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:23.210
Let's work together to stop Tamamo-no-Mae's plot!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:27.140
Indeed, I can't let them take over the world.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.930
Not to mention, it is sheer folly to alter the past.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:33.060
It's a good opportunity for us three to get together.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:36.850
Tamamo-no-Mae used your regret to trigger the activation of her powers.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:40.520
To overcome that, you just need to get rid of things that made you feel remorse.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:41.770
But how do I?

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:45.030
Skip across time to find hints in the past!

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.780
Is something like that really possible?

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.570
We're already in the past, aren't we?

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:54.500
I don't think that fox expected her spirit to have returned to your body.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:58.750
So her powers didn't work how she thought they would, and I took advantage of that.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.750
Let's go back in time.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.630
Okay, I'm out!

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:08.180
What? I lose again?

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:09.800
All right, Tsukuyomi, take it off!

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:13.390
But I only have one piece of underwear left!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.390
Can you not put down the bag instead?

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.310
I can't let go of this!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.860
But I don't want to take off the last of my underwear, either.

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:21.860
I know, Paparin!

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:25.990
You could throw away the bag and cover your face with your boxers instead.

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:27.740
That'll take care of everything!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:30.490
Oh, I hadn't thought of that!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.490
You're brilliant, Tama-san!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.580
Yay! He complimented me!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.290
That didn't take care of anything, did it?

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.160
Where are we?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.420
Sorry, looks like I got the wrong time.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:44.170
You seem to be making the most out of life.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.800
Yep! I have so much fun every day!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.970
Sasami, I think she was being sarcastic.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.470
Huh, she was?

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:53.560
Let's move on!

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:00.770
What are you doing?

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:06.230
This was just after Onii-chan and I had escaped from the Tsukuyomi Shrine.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:10.360
I nearly broke down from the guilt of running away.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:15.450
Whoa! Why are you in here?!

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:18.580
I'll always be by your side!

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:22.630
When you see me, you should imagine
there are thirty clones of me watching, too!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:25.840
Shut up, cockroach! Get out of here!

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:30.880
Dealing with my perverted brother meant I didn't have time to be depressed.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.180
It helped me get over it.

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:37.350
Here you go, Mom!

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.270
What is this?

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:42.190
A present for Mother's Day!

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:43.980
It's a day other people celebrate!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.190
Don't draw pictures, Sasami.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:50.860
It is improper to produce artwork.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:54.120
When people make a piece of art, it is imbued with their desires.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:59.330
The desires of someone who has the power of the supreme god can easily distort the world.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:02.870
If you have time to fool around,
then train more instead, you good-for-nothing!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:09.170
That made me really sad.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:13.550
It was unavoidable. It is part of the training for a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:22.890
But you <i>were</i> happy about it!

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:26.190
I was trained to restrain my emotions.

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:28.530
Moreover, it's true that making artwork is dangerous.

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:31.490
As a mother, I had to reprimand you!

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:33.280
Mom...

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.370
Mom, you look so happy.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:45.830
Upon birthing a child, happiness naturally follows.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.250
So, you did want me to be born?

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.630
Of course.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:53.760
Oh, look! Something fun's going on over there!

00:10:58.760 --> 00:10:59.310
Wait!

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:16.740
What does the next Tsukuyomi shrine maiden need from a loser like me?

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.530
"Concentrate on training! Don't go downtown!"

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:22.450
I'm sick of you lecturing me all the time, Nee-san!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.540
Ruza, I...

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.460
love you!

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:29.750
Ooh!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:30.460
You what?

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.470
Die!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.640
I didn't know Mom could be so passionate!

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:41.260
Don't look! Stop looking!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.020
Stop looking upon the mistake of my youth!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.270
Creation follows destruction.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.440
Only those who have been pushed to the brink of death,

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:57.280
glimpsing their imminent ruin, will gain true power.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.950
Look at my younger self being arrogant.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.870
That's some intense training!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:04.620
It's tough being a human.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.870
It's the Tsukuyomi shrine maiden's duty.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.790
Mom...

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.550
Let me ask you again, Sasami.

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:16.050
No matter how many times you ask, I won't go back to being the Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:18.640
You are the current Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:21.850
It's a duty that has been passed down from our ancestors,

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:24.430
so whether you take it or abandon it, you must make an earnest decision.

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:29.400
In these rapidly changing times,
when all nations are linked together,

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:33.110
I cannot leave this nation in the hands of the undisciplined Japanese gods.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:38.110
Thus, it's necessary for humans to protect and manage it.

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:40.070
You have a point.

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:43.330
The gods of our nation don't take things all that seriously.

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:46.580
They're weak, they're hesitant, and they often mess up.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:50.960
But that's why they can overcome their faults and improve.

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.960
Isn't that what it means to get stronger?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:58.170
You won't find paradise in your room or under your blanket.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:02.600
Even if people have a hard time at school and out in the real world,

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:05.220
they eventually become stronger. They grow and mature.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:08.140
Let's have a little more faith in the gods of this country.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.100
Let's send them out into the wider world.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:18.700
We're just borrowing the power of the supreme god. We're managers.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:21.410
This power does not belong to us.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:24.620
We'd be overstepping our bounds if we tried to hold on to it.

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:29.000
We don't need to work so hard for the world and its people.

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:32.380
The time our clan protected the world is over.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:35.130
I want to believe in the gods.

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:35.880
So...

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:38.130
I won't work hard anymore.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.680
We don't have to do that anymore.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:46.140
I'm still too young and naive.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:51.390
So I'll temporarily leave the power of the supreme god with you, Mom.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.020
In the meantime, I'll grow up and become stronger.

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:57.900
I'll become someone who won't be overwhelmed by the power of the supreme god.

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:01.910
So, those are your thoughts on the issue.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.370
Because I died too soon,

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:11.660
you were forced to become a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden before you could make up your mind.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:16.380
So you're just pampered. You can't handle the job because you lack determination.

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:17.670
That's what I thought of you.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.420
However...

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:24.340
You gave it some deep thought and came to your own conclusion.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:30.850
You recalled our true duty, the one no other has ever carried out since ancient times.

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.850
I am proud of you.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:37.980
You opposed me with strong conviction.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:41.110
I won't call you a traitor anymore.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.370
I was the foolish one. I was wrong.

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:51.370
You didn't do anything wrong.
You guys were just working <i>too</i> hard.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.500
Your family's been doing this pain-in-the-ass job for such a long time.

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.000
I really appreciate it.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.710
You've done enough now!

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:21.990
Isn't this...

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:23.440
the Heavenly Descent?

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:25.780
Now, what will you do?

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:32.000
This all began because I got tired of my job and threw my power away.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:35.750
I'm fine with starting it all over from the beginning.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.210
I've had plenty of rest.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:45.470
I left my work to you and took a long time off, more than I needed.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:48.850
But it ended up impoverishing humankind.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:51.140
That's something that should not happen.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:55.730
It's like the sun just went "I'm tired!" and stopped traveling across the sky.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.350
It's unforgivable.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:03.990
Whether the things your clan has done for
generations were right or wrong, I couldn't say.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:07.360
A lot of you went through great suffering, a lot of you died,

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.530
and this nation fell into disarray.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:12.490
It's because I was being a slacker.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.000
This is <i>my</i> regret.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.000
Answer me honestly.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:21.210
Did I do something wrong? Did I mess up?

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.210
I've been thinking about it for a long time,

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.220
but I could never figure out the answer.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:28.930
Maybe I should've tried a little harder.

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:33.680
You've worked hard for a long time.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:37.690
And, after a short break, came back.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.940
When you're tired, pass the baton.

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:43.020
I think that's the best way of running things.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:45.440
You did nothing wrong.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:51.700
Please God, don't feel regret over the way our history turned out.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:55.040
We'll work hard until the sun rises,

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.960
although it will shine no brighter than moonlight.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:01.460
Okay!

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:06.420
Now, time I ended your life, Tsukuyomi Juju!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:10.260
The Tsukuyomi Shrine will perish, and the Arahabaki shall be glorious!

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:14.350
Unfortunately, I promised someone that I'd work for a little while longer.

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.560
I can't let myself get killed here.

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.020
Wh-What is this?

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:24.360
You used our desire to change the past as a trigger to activate your power.

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:27.360
However, we now have no more regrets!

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:31.780
Impossible! Why's there a divine spirit inside Tsukuyomi Sasami?

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.990
I could've handled her if it was just that inexperienced girl, Sasami.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.000
Why is there such a powerful spirit?!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:45.670
Sorry, but I'm using you to help patch things up between a parent and child.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:47.050
Tsurugi?

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:51.680
You had an unusual power letting you go back in time, so I took advantage of it!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.430
Prepare yourself!

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:02.520
You took advantage of me?!

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:07.360
I'm the fox of white face, golden fur, and nine tails who has overtaken countless countries!

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:14.120
Now, I can finally carry out the true duty assigned to us by the supreme god in the ancient times.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:16.450
I'll kill you, and it won't be pretty!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.790
I'll turn you into minced meat to be consumed by debaucherous partygoers!

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.040
We must protect the world until the sun rises again.

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:26.170
That's what we, as the carrier of the Three Divine Treasures, pride ourselves upon!

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:53.150
All right, I'll leave things to you for a little while longer!

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:57.990
I'm back!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.990
Welcome back, Sasami-san!

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:02.330
Do you want me to help, Onii-chan?

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.210
Oh no.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.710
Please go inside, where it's warm.

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.880
It's fine! Let me help out.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:10.510
Oh, then I'll bring out another shovel,

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:13.510
and let's shovel the snow together so that the ladies in the neighborhood will go

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.840
"Oh, you two are so close for a brother and sister!"

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:18.720
Then we go "Brother and sister? We're husband and wife!"

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.350
Stop talking nonsense!

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:21.140
Hello...

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:24.390
Tsukuyomi Sasami-san.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.650
H-Hello.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:30.780
Um... Do I know you?

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:33.190
You're quite well known.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:36.200
You suddenly show up for school after being missing for a long time,

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.990
and you're the sister of one of the teachers.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:39.330
Wouldn't that make anyone a little curious?

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:43.160
Everyone wants to know more about you.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.080
I see.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:48.420
I'm the student council president at Konohanasakuya Academy,

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:51.090
so let me know if you run into any trouble.

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.920
Let's be friends.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.430
Oh, s-sure.

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:01.390
Oh, isn't that great, Sasami-san?

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:02.850
You made another friend.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:09.230
As her brother, I sincerely hope you'll get along with my sister.

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:10.230
However...

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:13.900
If you try to manipulate Sasami-san into doing something bad

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.150
or hurt Sasami-san in any way,

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:19.740
even if you are her friend, I won't forgive you.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:24.700
Are you an Emishi? A Tsuchigumo?

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.250
Actually, perhaps a Kumaso?

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:30.130
I don't think I am who you think I am.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:33.840
I see.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.340
You've made me even more curious.

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:37.880
You guys are interesting.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:38.760
Um...

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.510
What's your name?

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:41.470
Jou.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:44.100
I'm Edogawa Jou.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.480
An unusual name, isn't it?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.770
It was nice to meet you, Sasami-san!

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:53.610
You made me so worried.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:58.910
It's unusual for you to make a move on your own.

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:00.950
Didn't you hear me?

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:03.990
I'm really curious about her.

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:06.830
Curiosity killed the cat!

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.210
She has...

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:10.880
lost the power of the supreme god.

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:12.040
No way!

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:15.630
I detected a pretty strong divine power, even from here!

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.970
As you can tell from what's left of the sun god,

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:21.720
a fair amount of divine power remains in the emptied vessel.

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:25.220
I was all ready to suck out the power of the supreme god,

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:27.350
so that was unfortunate.

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:31.150
Still, it looks like things are going to get interesting.

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:32.440
I can't wait until we're second-years...

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.820
Or rather, until spring comes around.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:41.990
You are our master.

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:44.660
Even if it's destruction you desire,

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:47.450
we will obey.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:49.580
Yeah, I'll be counting on you.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:52.830
It's all for the sake of my happiness.

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:56.050
That is to say, it's to satisfy my selfish desires.

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:58.840
The evil occult society Arahabaki will use all of its resources to

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:03.760
spit in the face of those douchebags who act all high
and mighty because they're the gods of this country

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.560
or the world or whatever.

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:09.100
As you wish, Ojou-sama.

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:14.440
What is this? The ending?

00:22:14.440 --> 00:22:17.480
I never knew there was an alternative world established here.

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:20.900
This small-walled garden lies outside the reach of the power of the supreme god!

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:24.740
Let's occupy this world and make it the operational base of the evil occult society Arahabaki

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:28.160
as the first step in taking over the entire world!

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:32.420
Ojou-sama, the viewers will be driven off if you get so carried away on your first appearance.

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:35.710
Why? The first move is the most important!

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:39.420
But I guess it wouldn't be very gracious to invade without a formal declaration of war.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:42.510
I'll follow the rules of this alternative world, like the well-mannered lady I am.

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:44.720
So, what am I supposed to do?

00:22:44.720 --> 00:22:47.600
Whatever it is, I, Edogawa Jou, will blow everyone away!

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:50.980
Well, it looks like you just have to hold this microphone and sing.

00:22:50.980 --> 00:22:52.230
I have to what?!

00:22:52.230 --> 00:22:53.190
Well, whatever.

00:22:53.650 --> 00:22:57.270
Being a monotheistic deity in a polytheistic mythology, Arahabaki is a paradoxical entity.

00:22:57.270 --> 00:23:00.740
As descendant of its power, there's nearly nothing that's impossible for me!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:07.990
I can hear your voice!

00:23:07.990 --> 00:23:13.370
The symphony echoes off into the distance!

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:14.040
That's great, Ojou-sama!

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:19.750
A light shines through the thick color!

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:20.670
Wonderful!

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:23.380
As we hold each other's hands,

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:24.090
Yay!

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:27.800
our osmotic pressures accumulate.

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:28.890
You're the best!

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:31.430
I want to feel it!

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:32.680
That was easy!

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:34.270
That was amazing, Ojou-sama!

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:37.980
It's time, so let's go home and get some sleep where it's warm.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:40.360
I feel like I was manipulated into doing this.

00:23:44.240 --> 00:23:46.490
Time for Lazy@Wrestling.

00:23:46.490 --> 00:23:49.740
I'll be your commentator, Tsukuyomi Sasami.

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:52.580
In the red corner, we have Great Lazy.

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:55.620
In the blue corner, we have Lazy the Kid.

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:58.250
In the black corner, we have Lazy Animal.

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.880
Yellow is Lazy Isamu.

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:03.010
Pink is Rusher Lazy.

00:24:03.510 --> 00:24:05.170
Together these five make...

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:09.600
Next time, episode ten: "Fighting an Enemy You Can't See."
